<title>SWITZERLAND: CYCLING-WORLD ROAD RACE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-WORLD ROAD RACE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LUGANO, Switzerland 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
